# Dialects below keep a hand-written src/scanner.c (delegation shim) that IS
# tracked; parser.c and node-types.json are generated-only and ignored here -
# only their Brotli-compressed *.br blobs are committed (see
# scripts/compress-parsers.js / scripts/inflate-parsers.js). grammar.json is
# also generated-only (nothing reads it at build time). src/tree_sitter/*.h
# (the stock ABI headers) ARE committed plain - no longer ignored here.
# Snowflake and TSQL now also have a tracked scanner.c shim (added with this comment).
/hive/src/parser.c
/hive/src/*.json
/hive/tmp/
/mariadb/src/parser.c
/mariadb/src/*.json
/mariadb/tmp/
